-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  coff_pdb_msf.adam - The MSF file and the PDB streams (M7c), in this
  process: an MSF of 512-byte blocks whose largest stream crosses free map
  intervals, written and read back (its layout checked, every stream
  compared); then a PDB of two modules written from a made input (types, an
  id, symbols of every routing kind, nested scopes, lines over two files,
  contributions out of order, publics, two section headers), read back
  stream by stream against the writer's streams, written twice to the same
  bytes, and printed by PdbText (every stream decoded, each hash table's
  names looked up as a reader does).
*******************************************************************************/

