  |   global +0x64 procref 'm.Main' found
  | publics stream 9 hash 580 addrmap 16 thunks 0
  |   hash records 4 chains 4 in order
  |   public +0x0 pub 'main' found
  |   public +0x2C pub 'n_Run' found
  |   public +0x40 pub 'aaa' found
  |   public +0x14 pub 'm_GCount' found
  |   address +0x0 'main'
  |   address +0x2C 'n_Run'
